                        "review": "It's basically what would happen if you made Mario Kart 8, but faster. The game is incredibly quick, but not in a content kind of way, there is a lot of content and only more to come. The only thing I could think to request is more items and online crossplay. But I am grateful that we got 4 player co-op none-the-less.\n\nOverall, who am I kidding just buy the game already.",
